     "S3"
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "On 12855a41, with the lead car slowed to 0.75x at 200 ms delay, every repeat failed. The ego drifted left in slow traffic and its front-left hit car 51 in the adjacent lane, while the traffic ahead in its own lane was about 35 m away. In the one run each at 1.0x, 1.25x and \u22120.5 s shift, the ego did not fail.",
    "settings": [
     "S25",
     "S24",
     "S26",
     "S27"
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "On 19f339ba, with the lead car shifted \u22120.5 s and sped up to 1.25x at 200 ms delay, every repeat failed. The ego braked for no reason with no close lead, then angled left into car 1 in the adjacent lane. Any rear contact came after this front/side collision. At 0 s shift the ego did not fail in the few runs there.",
    "settings": [
     "S28",
     "S29",
     "S30"
    ]
   },
   {
